    <section class="practice" id="sect-00001"><title>Warm Up</title>
      <para id="para-00001">Expressions in different forms can be used to define the same function.
        Here are three ways to define a function <m:math display="inline">
          <m:mrow>
            <m:mi>f</m:mi>
          </m:mrow>
        </m:math>.</para>
